# 05 - Invalid usernames
# Purpose: Find source IPs trying usernames that do not exist, and how many distinct names they tried.
# Sourcetype: secure (auth log lines)
# Look for: One IP trying many different usernames, a sign of user enumeration.
# Time range: All time (the tutorial dataset is old, so recent ranges return nothing)
# Index: tutorial

index=tutorial sourcetype=secure "Invalid user"
| rex "Invalid user (?<user>\S+) from (?<src_ip>\S+)"
| stats count dc(user) as unique_users by src_ip
| sort -count
